": "screenshot_front_elevation.png", "id": "898712499715357", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_898712503048690_6138052247687145195_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j-SwseXN22IQ7kNvwHpNgQR&_nc_oc=AdqoD1LV2zrvkdAKaEaF4bQQDtm0b12rQLg8tNB5yyd84hPnNOQTI1FmcXVgqObZDX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3CN4tygq7oACEXiguvkeQJ36flogXJ4KXXJfB67isopg&oe=69F0CDCC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pixel Blocks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pixel Blocks revolutionizes VR gaming by combining **intuitive voxel creation** with **seamless multiplayer collaboration**.\n\n### Core Features\n\n- **Infinite Worlds**: Explore and build in massively scalable environments\n- **Real-Time Collaboration**: Build with friends instantly with zero lag\n- **GPU-Accelerated Rendering**: Thousands of blocks without performance issues\n- **Advanced Networking**: Instant synchronization across all players\n- **Built-In Voice Chat**: Immersive team communication without breaking immersion\n\n### Perfect For\n\n- Creative gamers and artists\n- Educators and students\n- Social communities and friend groups\n- Content creators and streamers\n\nPixelBlock transforms VR into a canvas for collaborative creativity.", "short_description": "Pixel Blocks is a collaborative VR voxel-building game where players create and explore shared worlds together in real-time. Use natural hand gestures to place and paint colorful blocks, build massive structures, and collaborate with friends instantly. Featuring cross-platform multiplayer, voice chat, optimized performance, and infinite scalability. Create, collaborate, and inspire on Meta Quest and compatible VR platforms."}]}, "developer_name": "adruian", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gamewaer.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "adruian", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gamewaer.com